@startuml
!include style.puml
title Runtime composition
component "SwingHost / GamePanel\nwindow, timer and frame" as desktop
component "JseEngine / SceneManager\nfixed updates and scene lifetime" as core
component "TitleScene / ArenaScene / ShowcaseScene\ninput and presentation" as scenes
component "ArenaRun\nWorld, AI, motion and rules" as run
component "Spawners and family factories\ncreation" as factory
component "EventBus, HUD and log\nnotifications" as events
component "Graphic and Renderer\ncomposable drawing" as graphics
desktop --> core : pump / render
core --> scenes : Scene callbacks
scenes --> run : advance simulation
run --> factory : initial entities
run --> events : run-owned events
scenes --> graphics : current frame
note bottom of core
Core uses Scene, EngineHost, InputSource and Renderer.
It does not depend on ArenaRun, World or EventBus.
end note
@enduml
